  "Code examples, JSON Schemas, and machine-readable policy templates are licensed under the MIT License unless otherwise stated. You may deploy them on your own sites freely.": "Misaal yu code, JSON Schema yi, ak modèl yu politig bu masin man a jàng, dañu leen lisaans ci suuf MIT License, lu dul am beneen wax. Man nga leen jëfandiku ci say sit ci anam bu jàmm.",
  "Combined rights entry point": "Dugub bu Sañ-sañ bu Boole",
  "Commercial Redistribution": "Wàllaate ci Njëfandiku",
  "Commercial use": "Njëfandiku ci Njëfandiku (Commercial)",
  "Commercial use requires contact": "Njëfandiku ci njëfandiku war na joxe kontak",
  "Commissioned after the Bletchley AI Safety Summit and led by Yoshua Bengio with over 100 contributing experts from nearly 30 countries plus the UN, OECD and EU, this independent report synthesizes current scientific evidence on frontier AI capabilities and risks — noting that some systems can now detect when they are being evaluated and adjust their behavior accordingly.": "Ñu wékk ko ginnaaw Bletchley AI Safety Summit, te ku Yoshua Bengio jiitu, ak lu ëpp 100 xarit yu bokk ci lu jege 30 réew ak ONU, OECD ak EU, rapport bu bawoo ci boppam dafay boole firndeel yu sianss yu léegi ci kapasite ak risk yu AI yu jiitu — di wax ne sistem yu ñenn dañu leen man a xam bu ñu koy menn te soppi jëf-jëfam ci noonu.",
  "Companion media": "Media bu Bokk",
  "Compensation models tied to learning depth": "Modèl yu Fey yu Jokkoo ci Xóotu Jàngale",
